senses.gloss:
शङ्कित (तः-ता-तं)
a. Alarmed; weak;
doubtful.

शङ्कु (ङ्कुः) 2.
m. The trunk of a lop-
ped tree; scate fish; javelin;
stake; a number; fear; fibres of
a leaf; sin; a gnomon; demon;
goose; ant-hill;
Shiva; Kāma.

सङ्करी-कृत (तः-ता-तं)
a. Mixed;
outcaste.

स-ङ्कसुक (कः-का-कं)
a. Unsteady;
uncertain; weak; wicked.

स-ङ्क्षिप्ति (प्तिः) 2.
f. Abridgment;
change of feeling; ambuscade;
throwing, sending.

स-ङ्क्षोभ (भः) 1.
m. Overturning;
shaking; pride.

सङ्-क्ष्णुवान (नः-ना-नं)
p. Whetting;
inflaming.

सङ्गीति (तिः) 2.
f. Conversation;
science of singing, &c.
